.counter_debounce_us.help":"Duration minimale of inactivité, en microsecondes, requise avant de réarmer the comptage de I00 in counter mode. a value négative est traitée comme 0. Changement pris en compte au restartup.","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.counter_debounce_us.label":"Debounce counter I00","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.counter_total.help":"Editable cumulative value for I00 in counter mode. This correction immediately overwrites the current counter total, becomes the new long-term statistic, and is written to NVS immediately.","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.counter_total.label":"Counter total","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.edge_mode.help":"Edge to count for I00 en mode counter (0=falling, 1=rising, 2=both).","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.edge_mode.label":"Mode de front I00","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_active_high.help":"Si active, input I00 is considered active in high state.","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_active_high.label":"Active-high I00","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_c0.help":"Multiplier coefficient applied to pulse count de I00 in counter mode. Converts raw pulses to published cumulative value. Formula: value = c0 * pulses.","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_c0.label":"C0 Coefficient I00","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_name.help":"Readable name de input digitale I00.","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_name.label":"Input name I00","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_prec.help":"Nombre de decimales conservees for value calculee de I00 in counter mode.","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_prec.label":"Precision I00","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_pull_mode.help":"Mode de resistance interne applique a input I00.","cfgdocs.io.input.i00.i00_pull_mode.label":"Pull input I00","cfgdocs.io.input.i01.binding_port.help":"Identifier of physical port used by digital input I01. Value references an allowed compile-time binding, not a raw GPIO number.","cfgdocs.io.input.i01.binding_port.label":"Physical port I01","cfgdocs.io.input.i01.counter_debounce_us.help":"Duration minimale of inactivité, en microsecondes, requise avant de réarmer the comptage de I01 in count